Subject: [PATCH] refactor(persistence): expose atomic_write_bytes;
 chatgpt_import no longer imports migration.converter (L1 experiment)

PROPOSAL (Claude). The private _atomic_bytes helper moves next to
atomic_write_text as core.persistence.atomic_write_bytes; converter re-exports
it under its old name, so core_copy, deleted_receipts and write_receipts are
unchanged. Removing this single edge splits the 36-module import cycle into
13 + 12 modules (11 modules leave every cycle). Full suite unchanged (2638
passed, 15 skipped, 5 xfailed on 587d4a9).

